# Local-only toolchain state for the Node vector generators.
#
# node_modules/ is already ignored at the repository root. The upstream checkout
# and the bundle deliberately live in ~/.cache/dxdb-vectors/ instead of here:
# anything in this directory is rsynced to the shared build box by
# cargo-remote-3000 on every `make check`, and a 58 MB upstream checkout per
# build is a cost nobody should pay for a data file that is already committed.
node_modules/
